<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="在処"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="KOKO"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="幸祜"/><amll:meta key="album" value="在処"/><amll:meta key="album" value="在処 - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPY392503319"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2711525627"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0048nJpv2YGzat"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="583659058"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="2lcYQoGPzckVhbEQo39hWK"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1818295142"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:40.700"><div begin="0.890" end="3:40.700"><p begin="0.890" end="2.940" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.890" end="1.160">誰</span><span begin="1.160" end="1.350">が</span> <span begin="1.350" end="1.640">見</span><span begin="1.640" end="1.800">え</span><span begin="1.800" end="2.050">る</span> <span begin="2.050" end="2.200">聞</span><span begin="2.200" end="2.480">こ</span><span begin="2.480" end="2.640">え</span><span begin="2.640" end="2.940">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有谁 能够看见 能够听见</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">有誰 能夠看見 能夠聽見</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Who can see who can hear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">누군가 보이고, 들려</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Qui peut me voir ou m&apos;entendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quién puede ver puede escuchar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wer kann sehen wer kann hören</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quem pode ver, pode ouvir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кого видно кого слышно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Chi riesce a vedere a sentire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dare ga mieru kikoeru</span></p><p begin="3.500" end="5.760" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3.500" end="3.800">祈</span><span begin="3.800" end="3.910">っ</span><span begin="3.910" end="4.050">てい</span><span begin="4.050" end="4.440">る</span> <span begin="4.440" end="4.600">知</span><span begin="4.600" end="5.050">ろう</span><span begin="5.050" end="5.190">と</span><span begin="5.190" end="5.340">し</span><span begin="5.340" end="5.520">た</span><span begin="5.520" end="5.610">っ</span><span begin="5.610" end="5.760">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">祈祷着 即使想要去了解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">祈禱著 即使想要去了解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Praying even if trying to know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">기도하고 있어, 알려고 해봐도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si j&apos;essaie de savoir qui prie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estoy rezando aunque intente saberlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Betend auch wenn man versucht es zu wissen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Estou orando mesmo tentando saber</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я молюсь даже если пыталась узнать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sto pregando anche se cercassi di sapere</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Inotte iru shirou to shitatte</span></p><p begin="5.760" end="7.350" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.760" end="6.080">塞</span><span begin="6.080" end="6.190">い</span><span begin="6.190" end="6.330">で</span><span begin="6.330" end="6.620">る</span> <span begin="6.620" end="6.920">黙</span><span begin="6.920" end="7.040">っ</span><span begin="7.040" end="7.220">てい</span><span begin="7.220" end="7.350">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却被阻挡 保持着沉默</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">卻被阻擋 保持著沉默</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Shutting away remaining silent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가로막혀 있어, 침묵하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me referme et je reste silencieuse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estoy bloqueada estoy en silencio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verschlossen schweigend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Estou bloqueando estou em silêncio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Закрываю уши молчу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sto bloccando tutto sto rimanendo in silenzio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Fusaideru damatte iru</span></p><p begin="7.900" end="10.240" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.900" end="8.490">走</span><span begin="8.490" end="8.770">り</span><span begin="8.770" end="9.010">出</span><span begin="9.010" end="9.240">し</span><span begin="9.330" end="9.670">た</span><span begin="9.670" end="9.910">い</span><span begin="9.910" end="10.070">の</span><span begin="10.070" end="10.240">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明想要奔跑而出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">明明想要奔跑而出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even though wanting to start running</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">달려나가고 싶은데</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors que je veux m&apos;élancer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque quiero salir corriendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Obwohl ich losrennen möchte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Embora eu queira sair correndo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Хотя так хочу сорваться на бег</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se vorrei iniziare a correre</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hashiridashitai no ni</span></p><p begin="10.340" end="12.210" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.340" end="10.510">待</span><span begin="10.510" end="10.610">っ</span><span begin="10.610" end="10.780">てい</span><span begin="10.780" end="11.020">る</span> <span begin="11.330" end="11.640">届</span><span begin="11.640" end="11.770">い</span><span begin="11.770" end="11.920">てい</span><span begin="11.920" end="12.210">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待着 已经传达</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">等待著 已經傳達</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Waiting reaching</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">기다리고 있어, 닿고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;attends et cela me parvient</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estoy esperando está llegando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wartend es kommt an</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Estou esperando está alcançando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я жду это достигает меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sto aspettando ti sta raggiungendo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Matte iru todoite iru</span></p><p begin="12.500" end="17.510" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.500" end="12.790">笑</span><span begin="12.790" end="12.920">っ</span><span begin="12.920" end="13.080">てい</span><span begin="13.080" end="13.330">る</span> <span begin="13.620" end="14.100">面</span><span begin="14.190" end="14.780">影</span><span begin="14.780" end="15.790">が</span><span begin="15.900" end="16.070">凪</span><span begin="16.070" end="16.530">ぐ</span> <span begin="17.040" end="17.510">今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">微笑着 往昔的面容重归平静 就在此刻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">微笑著 往昔的面容重歸平靜 就在此刻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Smiling the vestige calms down now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">웃고 있어, 그 옛모습이 잔잔해지는 지금</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je souris et mes vestiges s&apos;apaisent maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estoy sonriendo tu imagen se calma ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lächelnd die Spuren der Erinnerung beruhigen sich nun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Estou sorrindo os vestígios se acalmam agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Смеюсь сейчас когда образ успокаивается</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sto sorridendo le tracce del passato si calmano ora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Waratte iru omokage ga nagu ima</span></p><p begin="37.030" end="39.630" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.030" end="37.300">現</span><span begin="37.300" end="37.630">実</span><span begin="37.630" end="37.740">と</span><span begin="37.740" end="37.820">非</span><span begin="37.910" end="38.220">対</span><span begin="38.310" end="38.740">称</span><span begin="38.740" end="39.630">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与现实形成非对称</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">與現實形成非對稱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Asymmetrically with reality</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">현실과 비대칭으로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">En asymétrie avec la réalité</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Asimétricamente a la realidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Asymmetrisch zur Realität</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Assimetricamente à realidade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Асимметрично реальности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Asimmetrico rispetto alla realtà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Genjitsu to hitaishou ni</span></p><p begin="40.050" end="43.340" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.050" end="40.180">飛</span><span begin="40.180" end="40.480">ぼう</span><span begin="40.480" end="40.610">と</span><span begin="40.610" end="40.760">し</span><span begin="40.760" end="41.020">た</span><span begin="41.020" end="41.590">二</span><span begin="41.590" end="41.910">つ</span><span begin="41.910" end="42.070">め</span><span begin="42.070" end="42.210">の</span><span begin="42.310" end="43.340">身体</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试图起飞的 第二具身躯</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">試圖起飛的 第二具身軀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The second body that tried to fly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">날아오르려 했던 두 번째 몸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce deuxième corps qui tentait de s&apos;envoler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un segundo cuerpo que intentó volar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der zweite Körper der zu fliegen versuchte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O segundo corpo que tentou voar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Второе тело что пыталось взлететь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il secondo corpo che ha cercato di volare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tobou to shita futatsume no karada</span></p><p begin="43.880" end="45.870" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.880" end="44.130">暗</span><span begin="44.130" end="44.470">闇</span><span begin="44.470" end="44.610">で</span><span begin="44.610" end="44.960">踠</span><span begin="44.960" end="45.060">い</span><span begin="45.190" end="45.480">て</span><span begin="45.480" end="45.630">い</span><span begin="45.630" end="45.870">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在黑暗中痛苦挣扎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在黑暗中痛苦掙扎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Struggling in the darkness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어둠 속에서 발버둥 치고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Se débat au milieu des ténèbres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estoy luchando en la oscuridad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sich windend in der Dunkelheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Está se debatendo na escuridão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Бьётся во тьме</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Si dimena nell&apos;oscurità</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kurayami de mogaite iru</span></p><p begin="46.170" end="48.740" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.170" end="46.460">真</span><span begin="46.460" end="46.750">実</span><span begin="46.750" end="47.050">は</span><span begin="47.050" end="47.500">平</span><span begin="47.500" end="47.900">等</span><span begin="47.900" end="48.740">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真相平等地</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">真相平等地</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Truth will equally</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">진실은 평등하게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La vérité de manière égale</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La verdad ataca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Wahrheit greift gleichermaßen an</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A verdade de forma igualitária</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Истина в равной степени</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La verità in modo equo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shinjitsu wa byoudou ni</span></p><p begin="49.150" end="53.320" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.150" end="49.510">襲</span><span begin="49.510" end="49.630">い</span><span begin="49.630" end="49.770">か</span><span begin="49.770" end="49.910">か</span><span begin="49.910" end="50.200">る</span> <span begin="50.200" end="50.760">紅</span><span begin="50.760" end="50.900">の</span><span begin="50.900" end="51.340">糸</span><span begin="51.340" end="51.610">を</span><span begin="51.610" end="52.480">絡</span><span begin="52.480" end="52.860">ま</span><span begin="52.860" end="53.050">せ</span><span begin="53.050" end="53.320">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">席卷而来 将红线缠绕交织</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">席捲而來 將紅線纏繞交織</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Assault entangling the crimson threads</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">덮쳐와, 붉은 실을 얽어매며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">S&apos;abat sur moi en emmêlant ses fils cramoisis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por igual enredando el hilo carmesí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den purpurroten Faden verflechtend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ataca emaranhando o fio carmesim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Набрасывается сплетая красные нити</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ci assale intrecciando il filo cremisi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Osoikakaru kurenai no ito o karamasete</span></p><p begin="53.640" end="55.230" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.640" end="53.920">確</span><span begin="53.920" end="54.290">率</span><span begin="54.290" end="54.610">弾</span><span begin="54.610" end="54.760">き</span><span begin="54.760" end="55.100">出</span><span begin="55.100" end="55.230">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">推算出最终的概率</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">推算出最終的概率</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Deriving the probability</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">확률을 산출해 내지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Établissant de froides probabilités</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Calculando las probabilidades</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Wahrscheinlichkeit berechnend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Calculando as probabilidades</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Высчитывая вероятности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Calcolando la probabilità</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kakuritsu hajikidasu</span></p><p begin="55.630" end="59.060" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.630" end="56.190">あ</span><span begin="56.190" end="57.950">あ</span> <span begin="57.950" end="58.240">あ</span><span begin="58.240" end="59.060">あ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 아아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">А-а а-а</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa aa</span></p><p begin="59.330" end="1:03.490" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.330" end="59.500">手</span><span begin="59.620" end="59.930">繰</span><span begin="59.930" end="1:00.190">り</span><span begin="1:00.190" end="1:00.350">寄</span><span begin="1:00.450" end="1:01.190">せ</span> <span begin="1:01.590" end="1:01.760">手</span><span begin="1:01.760" end="1:01.920">を</span><span begin="1:01.920" end="1:02.190">伸</span><span begin="1:02.190" end="1:02.320">ば</span><span begin="1:02.320" end="1:02.670">す</span><span begin="1:02.670" end="1:03.490">者</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">循着丝线 伸出双手之人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">循著絲線 伸出雙手之人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The one who reels in and reaches out a hand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끌어당기며 손을 뻗는 자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Celui qui tire le fil et tend la main</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aquel que tira hacia sí y extiende la mano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Diejenige die es heranzieht und die Hand ausstreckt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Aquela que puxa o fio e estende a mão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Та кто притягивает к себе и протягивает руку</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Colui che tira a sé colui che allunga la mano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Taguriyose te o nobasu mono</span></p><p begin="1:04.780" end="1:08.200" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.780" end="1:05.330">あ</span><span begin="1:05.330" end="1:07.040">あ</span> <span begin="1:07.040" end="1:07.320">あ</span><span begin="1:07.320" end="1:08.200">あ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 아아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">А-а а-а</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa aa</span></p><p begin="1:08.500" end="1:17.560" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.500" end="1:09.640">私</span><span begin="1:09.640" end="1:10.300">は</span> <span begin="1:10.740" end="1:10.960">そ</span><span begin="1:11.060" end="1:11.340">こ</span><span begin="1:11.340" end="1:11.490">に</span><span begin="1:11.490" end="1:11.770">立</span><span begin="1:11.770" end="1:11.880">つ</span> <span begin="1:11.880" end="1:12.210">そ</span><span begin="1:12.210" end="1:12.490">の</span><span begin="1:12.610" end="1:13.080">為</span><span begin="1:13.080" end="1:13.370">に</span><span begin="1:13.880" end="1:15.200">戻</span><span begin="1:15.200" end="1:15.340">る</span><span begin="1:15.340" end="1:15.560">か</span><span begin="1:15.560" end="1:17.560">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将 伫立于那里 只为那般才会归来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我將 佇立於那裡 只為那般才會歸來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I will stand there because I will return for that sake</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 그곳에 설 거야, 그러기 위해 돌아갈 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me tiendrai là car je reviens juste pour cela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo estaré allí volveré por ese motivo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde dort stehen denn dafür kehre ich zurück</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu estarei lá porque voltarei para isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду стоять там и ради этого я вернусь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io starò in piedi là perché ritornerò per quel motivo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi wa soko ni tatsu sono tame ni modoru kara</span></p><p begin="1:18.170" end="1:18.790" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.170" end="1:18.390">今</span><span begin="1:18.480" end="1:18.650">で</span><span begin="1:18.650" end="1:18.790">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事到如今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">事到如今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même encore maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst jetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ancora adesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ima demo</span></p><p begin="1:18.880" end="1:20.990" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.880" end="1:19.480">心</span><span begin="1:19.480" end="1:19.620">の</span><span begin="1:19.620" end="1:19.880">雨</span><span begin="1:19.880" end="1:20.040">は</span><span begin="1:20.040" end="1:20.180">止</span><span begin="1:20.180" end="1:20.360">ま</span><span begin="1:20.360" end="1:20.470">っ</span><span begin="1:20.470" end="1:20.630">て</span><span begin="1:20.630" end="1:20.830">な</span><span begin="1:20.830" end="1:20.910">く</span><span begin="1:20.910" end="1:20.990">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心底的雨依然未曾停歇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">心底的雨依然未曾停歇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The rain in my heart has not stopped</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마음의 비는 그치지 않았고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La pluie dans mon cœur ne s&apos;est pas arrêtée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La lluvia en mi corazón no se ha detenido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hat der Regen in meinem Herzen nicht aufgehört</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A chuva no meu coração não parou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Дождь в моем сердце всё еще не прекратился</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La pioggia nel mio cuore non è cessata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kokoro no ame wa tomatte nakute</span></p><p begin="1:21.180" end="1:23.900" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.180" end="1:21.620">言</span><span begin="1:21.620" end="1:21.760">葉</span><span begin="1:21.760" end="1:21.890">の</span><span begin="1:21.890" end="1:22.050">意</span><span begin="1:22.050" end="1:22.170">味</span><span begin="1:22.170" end="1:22.340">を</span><span begin="1:22.340" end="1:22.780">放</span><span begin="1:22.780" end="1:22.920">り</span><span begin="1:22.920" end="1:23.080">出</span><span begin="1:23.080" end="1:23.200">し</span><span begin="1:23.200" end="1:23.360">た</span><span begin="1:23.360" end="1:23.480">っ</span><span begin="1:23.480" end="1:23.900">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕抛却言语的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哪怕拋卻言語的意義</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if I throw away the meaning of words</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">말의 의미를 내팽개친다 해도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si je rejette le sens des mots</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque abandone el significado de las palabras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch wenn ich die Bedeutung der Worte wegwerfe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que eu abandone o significado das palavras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже если я отбросила смысл слов</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se gettassi via il significato delle parole</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kotoba no imi o houridashitatte</span></p><p begin="1:24.610" end="1:26.460" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.610" end="1:24.750">逃</span><span begin="1:24.750" end="1:24.890">げ</span><span begin="1:24.890" end="1:25.050">ら</span><span begin="1:25.050" end="1:25.180">れ</span><span begin="1:25.180" end="1:25.280">は</span><span begin="1:25.280" end="1:25.470">し</span><span begin="1:25.470" end="1:25.650">な</span><span begin="1:25.650" end="1:25.700">い</span><span begin="1:25.700" end="1:26.210">命</span><span begin="1:26.210" end="1:26.460">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这无处可逃的命运中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在這無處可逃的命運中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With a life from which I cannot escape</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">도망칠 수 없는 목숨이라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec cette vie dont on ne peut s&apos;échapper</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con esta vida de la que no puedo escapar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit einem Leben dem ich nicht entfliehen kann</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Em uma vida da qual não se pode fugir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В этой жизни от которой не сбежать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In questa vita da cui non posso sfuggire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nigerare wa shinai inochi de</span></p><p begin="1:26.720" end="1:27.950" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.720" end="1:27.060">そ</span><span begin="1:27.060" end="1:27.350">れ</span><span begin="1:27.350" end="1:27.540">で</span><span begin="1:27.630" end="1:27.790">も</span><span begin="1:27.790" end="1:27.950">いい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那也無妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even that is fine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 괜찮아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce n&apos;est pas grave ainsi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aun así está bien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ist in Ordnung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo assim está tudo bem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пусть будет так</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi va bene lo stesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Soredemo ii</span></p><p begin="1:28.000" end="1:30.170" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.000" end="1:28.470">定</span><span begin="1:28.470" end="1:28.610">め</span><span begin="1:28.610" end="1:28.760">ら</span><span begin="1:28.760" end="1:28.900">れ</span><span begin="1:28.900" end="1:29.070">た</span><span begin="1:29.070" end="1:29.340">運</span><span begin="1:29.340" end="1:29.620">命</span><span begin="1:29.620" end="1:29.780">に</span><span begin="1:29.780" end="1:29.930">だ</span><span begin="1:29.930" end="1:30.050">っ</span><span begin="1:30.050" end="1:30.170">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使面对注定的命运</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即使面對注定的命運</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even against the predestined fate</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">정해진 운명이라 해도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même face à un destin déjà tracé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso contra el destino predeterminado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst gegen das vorherbestimmte Schicksal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo contra o destino predeterminado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже если против предрешенной судьбы</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche di fronte a un destino già segnato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sadamerareta unmei ni datte</span></p><p begin="1:30.350" end="1:33.080" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.350" end="1:30.960">抗</span><span begin="1:30.960" end="1:31.060">い</span><span begin="1:31.060" end="1:31.330">惨</span><span begin="1:31.330" end="1:31.480">め</span><span begin="1:31.480" end="1:31.590">に</span><span begin="1:31.590" end="1:31.890">斃</span><span begin="1:31.890" end="1:32.080">さ</span><span begin="1:32.080" end="1:32.240">れ</span><span begin="1:32.340" end="1:32.530">た</span><span begin="1:32.530" end="1:32.630">っ</span><span begin="1:32.630" end="1:33.080">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奋起反抗落得惨败而亡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">奮起反抗落得慘敗而亡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if I defy it and am miserably defeated</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">저항하다 처참히 쓰러진다 해도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si je suis misérablement abattue en luttant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque me resista y sea derrotada miserablemente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch wenn ich mich wehre und kläglich niedergestreckt werde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que eu resista e seja miseravelmente derrotada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду сопротивляться и буду жалко повержена</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se dovessi oppormi ed essere abbattuta miseramente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aragai mijime ni taosaretatte</span></p><p begin="1:33.590" end="1:35.810" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.590" end="1:33.620">「</span><span begin="1:33.620" end="1:33.860">約</span><span begin="1:33.860" end="1:34.460">束</span><span begin="1:34.460" end="1:34.490">」</span><span begin="1:34.490" end="1:34.790">が</span><span begin="1:34.790" end="1:35.080">あ</span><span begin="1:35.080" end="1:35.480">る</span><span begin="1:35.480" end="1:35.640">か</span><span begin="1:35.640" end="1:35.810">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为有着「约定」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為有著「約定」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because there is a &quot;promise&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">「약속」이 있으니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Puisqu&apos;il y a notre « promesse »</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque hay una «promesa»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weil es ein &quot;Versprechen&quot; gibt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque existe uma «promessa»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">У меня есть «обещание»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Poiché c&apos;è una «promessa»</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">&quot;Yakusoku&quot; ga aru kara</span></p><p begin="1:36.180" end="1:40.160" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.180" end="1:36.780">何</span><span begin="1:36.780" end="1:37.070">度</span><span begin="1:37.070" end="1:37.230">で</span><span begin="1:37.340" end="1:38.060">も</span> <span begin="1:38.060" end="1:38.090">「</span><span begin="1:38.090" end="1:38.190">こ</span><span begin="1:38.190" end="1:38.350">こ</span><span begin="1:38.350" end="1:38.380">」</span><span begin="1:38.380" end="1:38.760">に</span><span begin="1:38.760" end="1:39.350">帰</span><span begin="1:39.350" end="1:39.600">る</span><span begin="1:39.600" end="1:39.950">為</span><span begin="1:39.950" end="1:40.160">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论多少次 为了能够回到「这里」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論多少次 為了能夠回到「這裡」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In order to return &quot;here&quot; again and again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">몇 번이든 「이곳」으로 돌아가기 위해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour retourner « ici » maintes et maintes fois</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Para regresar a «aquí» una y otra vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Um immer wieder &quot;hierher&quot; zurückzukehren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para retornar «aqui» não importa quantas vezes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы раз за разом возвращаться «сюда»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per poter tornare «qui» innumerevoli volte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nando demo &quot;koko&quot; ni kaeru tame ni</span></p><p begin="1:40.440" end="1:46.500" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.440" end="1:40.600">そ</span><span begin="1:40.600" end="1:41.060">の</span><span begin="1:41.060" end="1:41.330">名</span><span begin="1:41.330" end="1:41.650">を</span><span begin="1:41.650" end="1:41.920">呼</span><span begin="1:41.920" end="1:43.400">ぶ</span><span begin="1:43.890" end="1:44.100">か</span><span begin="1:44.100" end="1:46.500">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会呼唤那个名字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我都會呼喚那個名字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I will call that name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 이름을 부를 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;appellerai ce nom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque gritaré ese nombre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde ich diesen Namen rufen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu chamarei esse nome</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду звать это имя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Chiamerò quel nome</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sono na o yobu kara</span></p><p begin="2:03.880" end="2:06.440" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.880" end="2:04.200">現</span><span begin="2:04.200" end="2:04.460">実</span><span begin="2:04.460" end="2:04.630">は</span><span begin="2:04.630" end="2:04.740">無</span><span begin="2:04.740" end="2:05.160">表</span><span begin="2:05.160" end="2:05.540">情</span><span begin="2:05.630" end="2:06.440">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现实面无表情地</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">現實面無表情地</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Reality expressionlessly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">현실은 무표정하게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La réalité sans aucune expression</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La realidad sin expresión</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Realität ist ausdruckslos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A realidade de forma inexpressiva</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Реальность безэмоционально</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La realtà in modo inespressivo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Genjitsu wa muhyoujou ni</span></p><p begin="2:06.890" end="2:11.020" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.890" end="2:07.050">噛</span><span begin="2:07.050" end="2:07.220">み</span><span begin="2:07.220" end="2:07.340">付</span><span begin="2:07.340" end="2:07.460">く</span><span begin="2:07.460" end="2:07.910">事</span> <span begin="2:07.910" end="2:08.320">恐</span><span begin="2:08.320" end="2:08.470">れ</span><span begin="2:08.470" end="2:08.610">た</span><span begin="2:08.610" end="2:09.080">牙</span><span begin="2:09.080" end="2:09.240">を</span><span begin="2:09.340" end="2:10.590">携</span><span begin="2:10.590" end="2:10.760">え</span><span begin="2:10.760" end="2:11.020">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">携带着恐惧咬噬的獠牙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">攜帶著恐懼咬噬的獠牙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Bites carrying the fangs it once feared</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">물어뜯는 것을 두려워한 송곳니를 품고서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Reste immobile arborant ses crocs qui craignent de mordre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Llevando colmillos que temen morder</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit Reißzähnen die sich davor fürchten zuzubeißen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Carregando presas que temiam morder</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Обнажает клыки что боялись укусить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostra le sue zanne timorose di mordere</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kamitsuku koto osoreta kiba o tazusaete</span></p><p begin="2:11.340" end="2:12.680" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.340" end="2:11.500">と</span><span begin="2:11.630" end="2:11.970">ど</span><span begin="2:12.060" end="2:12.240">ま</span><span begin="2:12.240" end="2:12.350">っ</span><span begin="2:12.350" end="2:12.510">てい</span><span begin="2:12.510" end="2:12.680">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">停滞不前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">停滯不前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Remaining still</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">머물러 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Elle me retient</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Se queda estancada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bleibt sie stehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Permanece parada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И замирает</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E rimane ferma</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Todomatte iru</span></p><p begin="2:13.020" end="2:15.730" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.020" end="2:13.330">真</span><span begin="2:13.330" end="2:13.590">実</span><span begin="2:13.590" end="2:13.900">は</span><span begin="2:13.900" end="2:14.350">混</span><span begin="2:14.350" end="2:14.770">沌</span><span begin="2:14.770" end="2:15.730">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真相在混沌之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">真相在混沌之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Truth aims at the crack</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">진실은 혼돈 속에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La vérité vise la fissure de la voûte céleste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La verdad apunta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Wahrheit zielt auf den Riss im blauen Himmel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A verdade no caos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Истина стремится</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La verità punta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shinjitsu wa konton ni</span></p><p begin="2:16.050" end="2:20.170" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.050" end="2:16.340">歪</span><span begin="2:16.340" end="2:16.490">め</span><span begin="2:16.490" end="2:16.590">ら</span><span begin="2:16.590" end="2:16.760">れ</span><span begin="2:16.760" end="2:17.030">た</span><span begin="2:17.030" end="2:17.330">蒼</span><span begin="2:17.330" end="2:17.650">穹</span><span begin="2:17.650" end="2:17.760">の</span><span begin="2:17.760" end="2:17.930">亀</span><span begin="2:17.930" end="2:18.360">裂</span> <span begin="2:18.470" end="2:18.880">目</span><span begin="2:18.880" end="2:19.300">指</span><span begin="2:19.300" end="2:19.760">し</span><span begin="2:19.760" end="2:19.880">てい</span><span begin="2:19.880" end="2:20.170">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着被扭曲的苍穹裂缝 进发</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">向著被扭曲的蒼穹裂縫 進發</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In the azure sky distorted by chaos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">일그러진 푸른 하늘의 균열을 향하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Déformée par le chaos le plus total</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hacia la grieta del cielo azul distorsionado por el caos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der durch das Chaos verzerrt wurde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Almeja a fenda no firmamento que foi distorcido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">К трещине в искаженном хаосом синем небе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Alla crepa del cielo distorto dal caos</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yugamerareta soukyuu no kiretsu mezashite iru</span></p><p begin="2:20.470" end="2:22.100" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.470" end="2:20.750">確</span><span begin="2:20.750" end="2:21.140">実</span><span begin="2:21.140" end="2:21.460">性</span><span begin="2:21.460" end="2:21.600">に</span><span begin="2:21.600" end="2:22.040">欠</span><span begin="2:22.040" end="2:22.100">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">缺乏着确切的定数</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">缺乏著確切的定數</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lacking certainty</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">확실성이 결여된 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Manquant cruellement de certitude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Carece de certeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es mangelt an Gewissheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Faltando com a certeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лишенная определенности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mancando di certezza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kakujitsusei ni kaku</span></p><p begin="2:22.460" end="2:25.740" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.460" end="2:23.040">あ</span><span begin="2:23.040" end="2:24.800">あ</span> <span begin="2:24.800" end="2:25.060">あ</span><span begin="2:25.060" end="2:25.740">あ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 아아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">А-а а-а</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa aa</span></p><p begin="2:26.200" end="2:29.940" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.200" end="2:26.500">手</span><span begin="2:26.500" end="2:26.800">繰</span><span begin="2:26.800" end="2:27.070">り</span><span begin="2:27.070" end="2:27.200">寄</span><span begin="2:27.330" end="2:27.900">せ</span> <span begin="2:28.500" end="2:28.620">手</span><span begin="2:28.620" end="2:28.790">を</span><span begin="2:28.790" end="2:29.050">伸</span><span begin="2:29.050" end="2:29.170">ば</span><span begin="2:29.170" end="2:29.510">す</span><span begin="2:29.510" end="2:29.940">者</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">循着丝线 伸出双手之人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">循著絲線 伸出雙手之人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The one who reels in and reaches out a hand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끌어당기며 손을 뻗는 자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Celui qui tire le fil et tend la main</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aquel que tira hacia sí y extiende la mano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Diejenige die es heranzieht und die Hand ausstreckt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Aquela que puxa o fio e estende a mão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Та кто притягивает к себе и протягивает руку</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Colui che tira a sé colui che allunga la mano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Taguriyose te o nobasu mono</span></p><p begin="2:31.650" end="2:34.880" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:31.650" end="2:32.210">あ</span><span begin="2:32.210" end="2:33.980">あ</span> <span begin="2:33.980" end="2:34.230">あ</span><span begin="2:34.230" end="2:34.880">あ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 아아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">А-а а-а</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa aa</span></p><p begin="2:35.360" end="2:44.670" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.360" end="2:36.490">私</span><span begin="2:36.490" end="2:37.100">は</span><span begin="2:37.640" end="2:37.930">そ</span><span begin="2:37.930" end="2:38.230">こ</span><span begin="2:38.230" end="2:38.380">に</span><span begin="2:38.380" end="2:38.670">立</span><span begin="2:38.670" end="2:38.750">つ</span> <span begin="2:38.750" end="2:39.070">そ</span><span begin="2:39.070" end="2:39.370">の</span><span begin="2:39.490" end="2:39.930">為</span><span begin="2:39.930" end="2:40.130">に</span> <span begin="2:40.820" end="2:41.460">も</span><span begin="2:41.460" end="2:42.140">う</span><span begin="2:42.140" end="2:42.540">一</span><span begin="2:42.540" end="2:44.670">度</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将伫立于那里 只为那般 再来一次</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我將佇立於那裡 只為那般 再來一次</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I will stand there once again for that sake</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 그곳에 설 거야, 그러기 위해 다시 한번</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me tiendrai là une fois de plus pour cela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo estaré allí por ese motivo una vez más</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde dort stehen dafür noch ein weiteres Mal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu estarei lá para isso mais uma vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду стоять там и ради этого еще раз</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io starò in piedi là ancora una volta per quel motivo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi wa soko ni tatsu sono tame ni mou ichido</span></p><p begin="3:03.320" end="3:03.920" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.320" end="3:03.610">今</span><span begin="3:03.610" end="3:03.800">で</span><span begin="3:03.800" end="3:03.920">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事到如今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">事到如今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même encore maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst jetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ancora adesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ima demo</span></p><p begin="3:04.040" end="3:06.130" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.040" end="3:04.620">心</span><span begin="3:04.620" end="3:04.750">の</span><span begin="3:04.750" end="3:04.890">場</span><span begin="3:04.890" end="3:05.050">所</span><span begin="3:05.050" end="3:05.210">は</span><span begin="3:05.210" end="3:05.340">変</span><span begin="3:05.340" end="3:05.520">わ</span><span begin="3:05.520" end="3:05.620">っ</span><span begin="3:05.620" end="3:05.770">て</span><span begin="3:05.770" end="3:05.970">な</span><span begin="3:05.970" end="3:06.040">く</span><span begin="3:06.040" end="3:06.130">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心的居所依然未曾改变</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">心的居所依然未曾改變</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The place of my heart has not changed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마음이 있는 곳은 변하지 않아서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La place de mon cœur n&apos;a pas changé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El lugar de mi corazón no ha cambiado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hat sich der Ort meines Herzens nicht verändert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O lugar do meu coração não mudou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Место моего сердца осталось прежним</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il luogo del mio cuore no non è cambiato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kokoro no basho wa kawatte nakute</span></p><p begin="3:06.330" end="3:09.200" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.330" end="3:06.760">言</span><span begin="3:06.760" end="3:06.890">葉</span><span begin="3:06.890" end="3:07.020">の</span><span begin="3:07.020" end="3:07.440">刃</span><span begin="3:07.440" end="3:07.590">が</span><span begin="3:07.590" end="3:07.920">飛</span><span begin="3:07.920" end="3:07.990">び</span><span begin="3:08.080" end="3:08.240">交</span><span begin="3:08.240" end="3:08.370">っ</span><span begin="3:08.370" end="3:08.540">た</span><span begin="3:08.540" end="3:08.670">っ</span><span begin="3:08.670" end="3:09.200">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕言语的利刃交错飞舞</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哪怕言語的利刃交錯飛舞</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if blades of words fly around</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">말의 칼날이 난무한다 해도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si les lames des mots volent de toutes parts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque vuelen espadas de palabras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch wenn Klingen aus Worten umherfliegen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que lâminas de palavras voem ao redor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже если вокруг летают клинки слов</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se volassero lame di parole</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kotoba no yaiba ga tobikattatte</span></p><p begin="3:09.790" end="3:11.610" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:09.790" end="3:09.930">逃</span><span begin="3:09.930" end="3:10.060">げ</span><span begin="3:10.060" end="3:10.200">ら</span><span begin="3:10.200" end="3:10.320">れ</span><span begin="3:10.320" end="3:10.460">は</span><span begin="3:10.460" end="3:10.620">し</span><span begin="3:10.620" end="3:10.770">な</span><span begin="3:10.770" end="3:10.810">い</span><span begin="3:10.810" end="3:11.310">命</span><span begin="3:11.310" end="3:11.610">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这无处可逃的命运中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在這無處可逃的命運中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With a life from which I cannot escape</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">도망칠 수 없는 목숨이라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec cette vie dont on ne peut s&apos;échapper</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con esta vida de la que no puedo escapar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit einem Leben dem ich nicht entfliehen kann</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Em uma vida da qual não se pode fugir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В этой жизни от которой не сбежать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In questa vita da cui non posso sfuggire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nigerare wa shinai inochi de</span></p><p begin="3:11.880" end="3:13.080" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.880" end="3:12.200">そ</span><span begin="3:12.200" end="3:12.490">れ</span><span begin="3:12.490" end="3:12.650">で</span><span begin="3:12.760" end="3:12.950">も</span><span begin="3:12.950" end="3:13.080">いい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那也無妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even that is fine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 괜찮아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce n&apos;est pas grave ainsi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aun así está bien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ist in Ordnung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo assim está tudo bem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пусть будет так</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi va bene lo stesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Soredemo ii</span></p><p begin="3:13.150" end="3:15.300" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.150" end="3:13.760">儚</span><span begin="3:13.760" end="3:13.900">く</span><span begin="3:13.900" end="3:14.030">消</span><span begin="3:14.030" end="3:14.200">え</span><span begin="3:14.200" end="3:14.300">て</span><span begin="3:14.300" end="3:14.490">し</span><span begin="3:14.490" end="3:14.670">ま</span><span begin="3:14.670" end="3:14.920">うん</span><span begin="3:14.920" end="3:15.100">だ</span><span begin="3:15.100" end="3:15.210">っ</span><span begin="3:15.210" end="3:15.300">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕会如幻影般消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哪怕會如幻影般消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if I disappear ephemerally</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">덧없이 사라져버린다 해도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si je dois disparaître de façon éphémère</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque desaparezca efímeramente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch wenn ich flüchtig verschwinde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que eu desapareça de forma efêmera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже если я эфемерно исчезну</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se dovessi svanire in modo effimero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hakanaku kiete shimaun datte</span></p><p begin="3:15.480" end="3:18.140" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:15.480" end="3:15.740">彼</span><span begin="3:15.740" end="3:16.040">方</span><span begin="3:16.040" end="3:16.180">に</span><span begin="3:16.180" end="3:16.330">意</span><span begin="3:16.330" end="3:16.600">識</span><span begin="3:16.600" end="3:16.780">を</span><span begin="3:16.780" end="3:17.080">追</span><span begin="3:17.080" end="3:17.160">い</span><span begin="3:17.160" end="3:17.370">や</span><span begin="3:17.370" end="3:17.470">っ</span><span begin="3:17.470" end="3:17.660">た</span><span begin="3:17.660" end="3:17.760">っ</span><span begin="3:17.760" end="3:18.140">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕将意识驱逐至远方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哪怕將意識驅逐至遠方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if my consciousness is driven to the far distance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">저편으로 의식을 몰아낸다 해도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si ma conscience est chassée vers le lointain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque destierre mi conciencia a la distancia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch wenn mein Bewusstsein in die Ferne getrieben wird</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que eu afaste a minha consciência para o além</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже если мое сознание будет отброшено вдаль</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se la coscienza venisse scacciata lontano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kanata ni ishiki o oiyattatte</span></p><p begin="3:18.720" end="3:21.050" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:18.720" end="3:18.750">「</span><span begin="3:18.750" end="3:19.020">約</span><span begin="3:19.020" end="3:19.600">束</span><span begin="3:19.600" end="3:19.630">」</span><span begin="3:19.630" end="3:19.890">は</span><span begin="3:19.890" end="3:20.240">消</span><span begin="3:20.240" end="3:20.650">え</span><span begin="3:20.650" end="3:20.810">な</span><span begin="3:20.810" end="3:21.050">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">「约定」绝对不会消失</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">「約定」絕對不會消失</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The &quot;promise&quot; will not vanish</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">「약속」은 사라지지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La « promesse » ne s&apos;effacera jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La «promesa» no desaparecerá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das &quot;Versprechen&quot; wird nicht verschwinden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A «promessa» não desaparecerá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">«Обещание» не исчезнет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La «promessa» non svanirà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">&quot;Yakusoku&quot; wa kienai</span></p><p begin="3:21.330" end="3:25.260" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:21.330" end="3:21.910">何</span><span begin="3:21.910" end="3:22.190">度</span><span begin="3:22.190" end="3:22.380">で</span><span begin="3:22.470" end="3:23.170">も</span><span begin="3:23.170" end="3:23.200">「</span><span begin="3:23.200" end="3:23.310">こ</span><span begin="3:23.310" end="3:23.470">こ</span><span begin="3:23.470" end="3:23.500">」</span><span begin="3:23.500" end="3:23.920">に</span><span begin="3:23.920" end="3:24.500">戻</span><span begin="3:24.500" end="3:24.770">る</span><span begin="3:24.770" end="3:25.070">為</span><span begin="3:25.070" end="3:25.260">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论多少次 为了能够回到「这里」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論多少次 為了能夠回到「這裡」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In order to return &quot;here&quot; again and again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">몇 번이든 「이곳」으로 돌아가기 위해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour revenir « ici » maintes et maintes fois</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Para volver a «aquí» una y otra vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Um immer wieder &quot;hierher&quot; zurückzukehren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para voltar «aqui» não importa quantas vezes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы раз за разом возвращаться «сюда»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per poter tornare «qui» innumerevoli volte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nando demo &quot;koko&quot; ni modoru tame ni</span></p><p begin="3:25.600" end="3:29.720" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:25.600" end="3:25.740">そ</span><span begin="3:25.740" end="3:26.190">の</span><span begin="3:26.190" end="3:26.480">名</span><span begin="3:26.480" end="3:26.760">を</span><span begin="3:26.760" end="3:27.040">呼</span><span begin="3:27.040" end="3:28.820">ぶ</span><span begin="3:28.990" end="3:29.190">か</span><span begin="3:29.190" end="3:29.720">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会呼唤那个名字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我都會呼喚那個名字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I will call that name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 이름을 부를 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;appellerai ce nom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque gritaré ese nombre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde ich diesen Namen rufen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu chamarei esse nome</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду звать это имя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Chiamerò quel nome</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sono na o yobu kara</span></p><p begin="3:30.470" end="3:34.460" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:30.470" end="3:31.050">何</span><span begin="3:31.050" end="3:31.350">度</span><span begin="3:31.350" end="3:31.530">で</span><span begin="3:31.620" end="3:31.940">も</span><span begin="3:32.290" end="3:32.320">「</span><span begin="3:32.320" end="3:32.450">こ</span><span begin="3:32.450" end="3:32.600">こ</span><span begin="3:32.600" end="3:32.630">」</span><span begin="3:32.630" end="3:33.070">で</span><span begin="3:33.070" end="3:33.340">在</span><span begin="3:33.340" end="3:33.500">り</span><span begin="3:33.590" end="3:34.060">続</span><span begin="3:34.060" end="3:34.190">く</span><span begin="3:34.190" end="3:34.340">よう</span><span begin="3:34.340" end="3:34.460">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论多少次 为了能继续存在于「这里」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論多少次 為了能繼續存在於「這裡」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So that I can continue to exist &quot;here&quot; again and again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">몇 번이든 「이곳」에 계속 존재할 수 있도록</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour continuer d&apos;exister « ici » à jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Para seguir existiendo «aquí» una y otra vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Damit ich immer wieder &quot;hier&quot; weiter existieren kann</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para continuar a existir «aqui» não importa quantas vezes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы раз за разом продолжать существовать «здесь»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per poter continuare a esistere «qui» innumerevoli volte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nando demo &quot;koko&quot; de aritsuzuku you ni</span></p><p begin="3:34.720" end="3:40.700" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:34.720" end="3:34.900">そ</span><span begin="3:34.900" end="3:35.340">の</span><span begin="3:35.340" end="3:35.610">名</span><span begin="3:35.610" end="3:35.940">を</span><span begin="3:35.940" end="3:36.200">呼</span><span begin="3:36.200" end="3:37.640">ぶ</span><span begin="3:38.140" end="3:38.380">か</span><span begin="3:38.380" end="3:40.700">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会呼唤那个名字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我都會呼喚那個名字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I will call that name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 이름을 부를 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;appellerai ce nom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque gritaré ese nombre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde ich diesen Namen rufen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu chamarei esse nome</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду звать это имя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Chiamerò quel nome</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sono na o yobu kara</span></p></div></body></tt>